cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Maxwellian_fit: automatic hot-electron temperature fitting of particle energy spectra"
abstract: >-
  Fits dN/dE = C exp(-E/T) to a particle energy spectrum and detects the
  exponential (hot-tail) portion of the spectrum automatically, so the fit
  range does not have to be chosen by hand. Includes a Tkinter GUI for
  interactive fitting and figure preparation.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Ong
    given-names: Jian Fuh
    affiliation: "Extreme Light Infrastructure - Nuclear Physics (ELI-NP)"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4526-626X"
version: 2.0.0
date-released: "2026-08-13"
repository-code: "https://github.com/StevE-Ong/Maxwellian_fit"
license: GPL-3.0
keywords:
  - laser-plasma interaction
  - particle-in-cell
  - hot electron temperature
  - energy spectrum
  - Maxwellian fit
